{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf55 Pizza Syndicate \u2013 Build Your Pizza Empire\u2026 and Play a Little Dirty!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004630/extras/8d01e2c845600e27c92f9aca5a605bce.poster.avif?t=1771024059\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004630/extras/8d01e2c845600e27c92f9aca5a605bce.webm?t=1771024059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004630/extras/8d01e2c845600e27c92f9aca5a605bce.mp4?t=1771024059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back to the late \u201990s and rediscover <i>Pizza Syndicate</i>, a hidden gem of business simulation! Manage your pizza restaurants across the city, craft the perfect menu, hire and train staff, and expand your franchise\u2014but why stop at honest business?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in the underground syndicate</strong> to sabotage competitors, influence the market, and secure your empire by any means necessary\u2014all with a humorous twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Pizza Empire:</strong> From a single pizzeria to a city-wide franchise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Management:</strong> Handle staff, pricing, marketing, and finances to stay ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground Syndicate Mechanics:</strong> Take advantage of quirky, mischievous underworld strategies to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humorous Retro Fun:</strong> Lighthearted events, tongue-in-cheek scenarios, and classic 2D isometric graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Tycoon Gameplay:</strong> Perfect for fans of business sims, economic strategy, and time management games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover this unique mix of strategy, humor, and retro charm, and see if you have what it takes to dominate the pizza world\u2014both above board and in the shadows!<br><br>The game is available and offered as part of a preservation effort and for educational purposes. <br>It was originally released in 1999 by Software 2000 and licensed to Activision Value Publishing.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004630?t=1771024059","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004630?t=1771024059","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004630/30a153a9eaefe8b947c1f4a7ac704f172bcbeb84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771024059","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004630/30a153a9eaefe8b947c1f4a7ac704f172bcbeb84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771024059","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf55 Pizza Syndicate \u2013 Build Your Pizza Empire\u2026 and Play a Little Dirty!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004630/extras/8d01e2c845600e27c92f9aca5a605bce.poster.avif?t=1771024059\" width=620 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004630/extras/8d01e2c845600e27c92f9aca5a605bce.webm?t=1771024059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004630/extras/8d01e2c845600e27c92f9aca5a605bce.mp4?t=1771024059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back to the late \u201990s and rediscover <i>Pizza Syndicate</i>, a hidden gem of business simulation! Manage your pizza restaurants across the city, craft the perfect menu, hire and train staff, and expand your franchise\u2014but why stop at honest business?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in the underground syndicate</strong> to sabotage competitors, influence the market, and secure your empire by any means necessary\u2014all with a humorous twist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Pizza Empire:</strong> From a single pizzeria to a city-wide franchise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Management:</strong> Handle staff, pricing, marketing, and finances to stay ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underground Syndicate Mechanics:</strong> Take advantage of quirky, mischievous underworld strategies to gain the upper hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humorous Retro Fun:</strong> Lighthearted events, tongue-in-cheek scenarios, and classic 2D isometric graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Tycoon Gameplay:</strong> Perfect for fans of business sims, economic strategy, and time management games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rediscover this unique mix of strategy, humor, and retro charm, and see if you have what it takes to dominate the pizza world\u2014both above board and in the shadows!<br><br>The game is available and offered as part of a preservation effort and for educational purposes. <br>It was originally released in 1999 by Software 2000 and licensed to Activision Value Publishing.</p>","developers":["Software 2000"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steam